# Street puddle (R12 ground cover): a flat dark-blue sheen with a few streaks of reflected cyan neon (dim NeonCyan,
# never the bright edge colour). One voxel high, lies on the asphalt. Long axis +x (along the street).
grid 5
size 44 26 1
slot water WindowOff
slot glint NeonCyan
ellipsoid 22 13 0 21 12 1 water
noise 0.35 3 water
ellipsoid 22 13 0 18 10 1 water
paint box 14 9 0 30 10 1 glint
paint box 18 15 0 26 16 1 glint
paint box 25 11 0 33 12 1 glint
